The patches in this directory change files of NVIDIA's kernel driver.

The lines a patch adds are Copyright (c) 2026 Zerone Laboratories and are
offered under the MIT licence below, so that they can be built into NVIDIA's
driver, which the GNU General Public License used for the rest of this project
would not allow.

The lines a patch removes, and the unchanged lines shown around each change,
are NVIDIA Corporation's and remain under the licence of the driver they come
from. They are quoted only as far as a patch needs in order to apply.

